# src/apps/daemon/internal/foundation/redact

## Purpose
Central value redaction helpers for logs, public responses, and persisted safe snapshots.

## Architectural role
- Daemon dependency band: `foundation` (rank 0; lower rank = deeper implementation).
- Cross-band imports may point only to a lower rank. Same-band imports are allowed when they remain within one architectural layer.

## Contents
- Direct files (2): `redact.go`, `redact_test.go`

## Interfaces and dependencies
- Go package: `redact`.
- Notable exported surface: `Bytes`, `Redactable`, `SlogAttr`, `SlogErr`, `String`, `Value`.
- Daemon-local dependencies: none.
- Direct daemon callers: `internal/adapters/api`, `internal/integrations/sub`, `internal/protocols/tarpit`.

## Invariants
- `foundation` code must not import a higher-rank daemon band.

